:53:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9327479600906372,"text_excerpt":"AMAZING PLACE. AMAZING SERVICE. AMAZING FOOD!!! I love fried shrimp with hot sausage patty poboy - So many poboy shops won't make it b/c \"they don't have an extra meat button\". Well this place does! CAN'T BEAT THEIR FOOD OR CUSTOMER SERVICE!!"},{"business_id":"0xEyGDYQUasuNdAB1WWitQ","review_id":"0gusdzFwdUifwyZwin0YzA","date":"2016-05-29T23:28:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9150624871253967,"text_excerpt":"I really love this place. The roast beef. The hamburger poboy. The muffaletta. The club sandwich. Highly recommended! Pass up that unmentionable place on the corner and come here instead. Way better."},{"business_id":"0xEyGDYQUasuNdAB1WWitQ","review_id":"uT3bVPVSEn4_1z6287DdJg","date":"2012-10-31T21:35:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9018954038619995,"text_excerpt":"This place is in the middle of a neighborhood and it looks like a medium size shed. While the outside doesn't look like much, the food inside is delicious. If you don't care about calories, give the Thursday special a try: Homemade Chicken Fried Steak , Homemade Baked Mac, and Homemade Smothered Greens. Yes, HOMEMADE... Delicious! Sure you will feel like a fat ass after eating it, but life needs its guilty pleasures. Another favorite of mine on the menu, Meatball poboy dressed with mozzarella cheese."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
